\\\'','\\\\''refused'\\\\'','\\\\''matched'\\\\'')])\n'\"","aggregated_output":"A2 reproducer: 0.34694500000000006 0.08241180000000001 1 {'ceiling': 0.5, 'spent': 0.4293568000000001, 'reserved': 0.0, 'overrun': False, 'stopped': True, 'stop_reason': 'a reservation of $0.082412 would pass the $0.50 ceiling', 'refused': 1, 'attempts': 1} the shared budget ceiling would be passed: not sent\nA2 alters verdict: inconclusive (incomplete)\nA missing raw v7 answer passes completeness: pass\nA malformed reading can pass: pass\nUnfinished Part C can claim confirmed harm: not ready\nReordered properties changed the bytes: True problems: []\nPlan counts, unique request texts [('acceptance', 3, 3), ('refused', 16, 16), ('matched', 12, 12)]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
